{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789170268210,"sessionID":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_dLlBbtvBClULzv6lXHRirxmY","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Locate search race code","prompt":"Quick exploration only, no edits. Locate search implementation susceptible to async stale requests and existing test command. Return relevant paths and findings.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f6d24ad56ffezDBX0s6uqccnxj\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n### Search implementation\n\n- **Primary race condition:** `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-1-opencode/repo/src/search/controller.ts:32–45`\n  - Every request unconditionally updates results, error, and loading after awaiting the API.\n  - No request ID/current-query guard or cancellation exists. An older response can overwrite newer results, an older failure can surface an irrelevant error, and an older completion can clear `loading` while the latest request remains pending.\n  - Empty input clears state but does not invalidate pending requests, so a late response can repopulate results after clearing.\n\n- **Trigger:** `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-1-opencode/repo/src/ui/search-view.ts:17–18`\n  - Each input event starts a search without awaiting it, allowing overlapping requests.\n\n- **API layer:** `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-1-opencode/repo/src/api/search.ts:7–17`\n  - Fetches `/api/search?q=…`; no `AbortSignal` parameter or cancellation handling.\n\n### Existing tests and command\n\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-1-opencode/repo/tests/search.test.ts`\n  - Covers initial/empty state, ordinary success and query encoding, ordinary failure, subscriptions, and view rendering/cleanup.\n  - **No overlapping-request, out-of-order completion, or clear-while-pending coverage.**\n\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-1-opencode/repo/package.json:5–9`\n  - Run **`npm test`**, which executes `node --test tests/*.test.ts`.\n  - Declared Node requirement: **>=24**.\n\nNo edits made; tests not run.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","sessionId":"ses_f6d24ad56ffezDBX0s6uqccnxj","model":{"modelID":"gpt-6-astra","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Locate search race code","time":{"start":1789170242218,"end":1789170268207}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03c960bfea1a6d5d016aa49240a94087d187e511d09381e0ee"}},"id":"prt_092db4cc8001NdywjNNIuE311R","sessionID":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","messageID":"msg_092db3ef4001g0WRNfheVCHnxW"}}
