{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170280220,"sessionID":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","part":{"id":"prt_092dbdf93001dsf3h7SErW0ISI","messageID":"msg_092dbd15f001wId75raFNSnfwp","sessionID":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","type":"text","text":"The controller lets every completed request update state, even after a newer search or a query clear. I’ll add a request counter and guard results, errors, and loading updates so only the latest search can change them, without changing the public API.","time":{"start":1789170278291,"end":1789170280218},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0b1962fa51166543016aa492663ba487d1bb362ce22bc2c937","phase":"commentary"}}}}
