{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170298395,"sessionID":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","part":{"id":"prt_092dc2136001ttOpk08kaTMjNK","messageID":"msg_092dc1ade00178UoI7TYkzxbGI","sessionID":"ses_f6d24c1bfffec9G3ENxRK1DPXm","type":"text","text":"Fixed the race condition in `src/search/controller.ts` with a per-controller request counter.\n\n- Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading.\n- Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests, preventing late responses from restoring results or errors.\n- The public API and normal search behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification: `npm test` passed all 4 existing tests; `git diff --check` passed. The existing tests do not cover overlapping requests. No tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789170295094,"end":1789170298394},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_07e4b592449c522b016aa4927708b887d1a87da4ed5467c0c8","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
